sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor TestSuite as Test Suite (tests/*.matrix)
    participant Client as TestClient
    participant Kernel as Application.handle_request()
    participant MW as Onion Pipeline & Router
    participant App as Controller / Models / DB
    participant Res as TestResponse

    Note over TestSuite, Client: 1. Fluent Setup & Request Assembly
    TestSuite->>Client: app.test_client()
    TestSuite->>Client: .acting_as(user) [mints HS256 JWT]
    TestSuite->>Client: .post_json("/api/posts", payload)

    Note over Client, Kernel: 2. In-Memory Direct Kernel Dispatch (0 Sockets / 0 Ports)
    Client->>Kernel: handle_request(raw_req_map)
    Kernel->>MW: Run Global MW, Auth & Prefix Router
    MW->>App: Invoke Controller & QueryBuilder
    App-->>MW: Return Model / JSON Map
    MW-->>Kernel: Return HTTP Response Map

    Note over Kernel, Res: 3. Fluent Assertions & Dot-Path Inspection
    Kernel-->>Client: raw_res {status, headers, body}
    Client->>Res: new TestResponse(raw_res)
    TestSuite->>Res: .assert_created() [checks 201]
    TestSuite->>Res: .assert_json_path("data.title", expected)
    TestSuite->>Res: .assert_header("content-type", "application/json")

